From 00abb30a914a87b88328e5b46308cd39c1b40005 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Codex <codex@openai.com>
Date: Sun, 23 Aug 2026 23:19:17 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] media: meson: add encoder rate control

Expose standard bitrate-mode, bitrate and peak-bitrate controls.

Add frame-level rate control and output time-per-frame interfaces.

Use completed access-unit sizes to adjust the next frame QP.

Append a standard filler-data NAL when CBR undershoots its budget.

Initialize the GXL full-microcode macroblock QP tables per command.

The zeroed table previously forced QP 0 despite the slice header.

Preserve QP across runtime bitrate changes at the next frame boundary.

Signed-off-by: Codex <codex@openai.com>
